324:Ein's sleeveless shirt reveals his strong arms at this very moment, filling my mind with the image of him carrying me while running and jumping in the streets filled with cherry blossoms...
325:He walks to one side and takes off his coat, then he moves vigorously to shake water droplets out of his fur. The mud, on the other hand, is much more difficult to clean from his fur. With mixed feelings, I drag him to a public restroom by the road.
